+/*
+ * 1262: one swap of several layers (kern.sweet_present_layers, SweetFramebuffer.cpp), composited by the 2D engine into
+ * the panel buffer that is not on screen, as Apple's display driver composites a swap's layers in hardware: layer 0
+ * first (copied), each layer above blended over it (source-over), every layer scaled from its source rectangle to its
+ * panel rectangle; then the corner mattes over the panel's corners. Needs 0905's flip (the back buffer is never
+ * scanned out while it is drawn); layer 0 must cover the panel (there is no fill). Same IB slots, fences and statistics
+ * as sweet_gpu_present. 0 queued, 1 busy (try again on the next tick), -1 not possible (the caller says why).
+ */
